/implementation_plan.artifact.md
*.artifact.md

# Release signing secrets. Copy app/keystore.properties.example and fill it in,
# or set the KEYSTORE_* env vars in CI. Never commit the keystore or its passwords.
/app/keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
